        "TileImage": "$($repository f7606890-2c29-4e9c-973b-9ae71facf9f6).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47,\r\rWe have found out more about this anit-ICA group. We have discovered that they call themselves the &quot;Blue Jays&quot;. We have tracked down some more of their members. They are taking refuge at a bank in New York City. They have hidden themselves as guards. Take them out 47, we are very close to ending this case.\r\rGood luck 47.",
